# These artifacts are served by the control service and consumed by `docker
# build` on a Linux host: a CRLF shebang (`#!/bin/sh\r`) makes exec fail in
# the container with "No such file or directory". Force LF on every checkout,
# Windows autocrlf included (the server also normalizes at serve time, but the
# source tree must not regress either).
* text eol=lf
